     // When it reaches max, it latches.
     // If we are here, we processed a valid cycle (inputs ok, config ok).
     // So bad_samples should be reset?
     // "Accepted cycle resets bad_samples to 0".
     // Yes, since we didn't return early due to rejection, this is an accepted cycle.
     ra_state.bad_samples = 0;
